&lt;p&gt;This type of work—work that changes the world—is what the tech industry was founded on. So, if you&#39;re ready to seize the endless opportunities and leave your mark, come join us.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THE ROLE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a highly motivated Hardware PCIe Engineer for Pure’s Datastore team. Pure builds the industry’s most innovative, high-performance, energy-efficient and TCO-optimised storage solution. As part of this team, you will help productize this differentiated storage solution for our customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU&#39;LL DO&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and drive the triage, root cause, and resolution of issues raised by internal teams, manufacturing, and JDMs.
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;PCIe Gen5 and Gen6 interfaces&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;NVMe features&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
