&lt;li&gt;Lead failure analysis and root cause investigations to support field issues and customer escalations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage automation and AI to improve issue triaging, utilizing company-supported tools like Augment and Glean to facilitate agent development and harness advanced AI skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide technical leadership and mentorship to junior engineers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We are primarily an in-office environment and therefore, you will be expected to work from the Santa Clara office in compliance with Everpure&#39;s policies, unless you are on PTO, or work travel, or other approved leave.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU BRING&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Over 5 years of experience in advanced interface issue troubleshooting, root cause analysis, and solution identification, encompassing complex system-level interactions across host, PCIe, and CXL interfaces in enterprise server and SSD environments. Developed and automated comprehensive validation and testing solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;BS in Electrical or Computer Engineering (or related field).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record in chip bring-up and product qualification.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with PCIe Gen5/Gen6.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficient with test equipment including PCIe analyzer, Exerciser or Jammer, I2C analyzer, and UART.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with PCIe compliance testing (SIG) for SSD products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficient in scripting with Python, BASH, and similar languages. Hands-on experience in a Linux environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Detail-oriented, analytical, process-driven, and customer-focused.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Thrive in fast-paced, evolving business environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear and effective communicator, both verbally and in writing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;PREFERRED QUALIFICATIONS&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;MS in Electrical or Computer Engineering (or related field).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in collaborating with hyperscale customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiar with ARM-based firmware architecture and understanding of PCIe LTSSM.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Skilled in SSD hardware design, development and standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiar with NVMe architecture and implementation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledgeable in major bus technologies, including Ethernet, DDR, NAND, SPI, and I²C.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid foundation in x86 and AMD platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
