&lt;h3 style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;Would you like to help seniors in need in your community? Are you interested in starting your Healthcare Career as a Caregiver but aren&#39;t sure where to start?&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join our Team of Heroes today and ask us about our PAID HHA Training, Flexible Scheduling and all of our LPN/RN Scholarship and Development Opportunities!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Enrolling in BAYADA&#39;s (PAID) Home Health Aide training course is a great way to start your caregiving career! Once finished, we’ll match you with clients you&#39;ll love, shifts that work with your availability, and provide you with the essential supplies needed to begin your new caregiving career.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Being a BAYADA Home Health Aide (HHA) is so much more than a job - its a chance to build one-on-one relationships with Regular and Consistent clients and make a meaningful difference in yours and your client&#39;s lives. When you come to work for BAYADA, you’ll be treated with appreciation and respect, as well as rewarded for your hard work. Let us help you take the next steps in your career! Invest in yourself and let us help you become a certified HHA!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;What You Need To Know:&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Classes Offred monthly&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Daily Schedule&lt;/strong&gt;: 9a-3p, M-F&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Paid Training&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In Office Training at our Falmouth Office (80 Davis Straits, Falmouth, MA 02540))&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;75 Hour Training Program (In Office)
