&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(224, 62, 45); font-size: 18pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;BAYADA Home Health Care&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pay:&lt;/strong&gt; $25/hour + mileage reimbursement&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Flexible assignments close to home in Brattleboro and other parts of Windham County&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Schedule:&lt;/strong&gt; Full-time, part-time, and per diem available.&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;u&gt; Weekends are priority&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Description&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;BAYADA Home Health Care is seeking compassionate and reliable individuals to join our team as Home Health Aides. In this role, you will provide one-on-one, in-home support to clients, helping them remain safe and comfortable in their own homes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;No prior experience is required—we provide paid training and ongoing support for the right individual.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist with personal care (bathing, grooming, toileting)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support activities of daily living (ADLs)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform light housekeeping and laundry&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare meals and assist with feeding&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide mobility assistance and transfers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Offer medication reminders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist with range-of-motion exercises&lt;/li&gt;
