&lt;li&gt;Reliable and compassionate with a desire to help others&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to travel to client homes as assigned&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Previous caregiving or healthcare experience is a plus, but not required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive pay: $25/hour + mileage reimbursement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Additional $2/hour for holiday shifts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;$500 referral bonus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to earn paid time off&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible scheduling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assignments close to home&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direct deposit&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;PPE provided&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;24/7 clinical and on-call support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Work with BAYADA?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
