&lt;p&gt;You will collaborate with the Food Systems Alliance at a pivotal moment as the organization transitions from bespoke operational tooling toward scalable software products that support the global supply chain. In this role, you’ll help translate complex business processes — such as route planning, procurement, and menu planning — into robust and reliable technical solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your initial focus will be enhancing and optimizing tools that support day-to-day production operations, while contributing longer term to the development of modular, globally scalable systems that support HelloFresh’s food supply chain across multiple regions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do: The Recipe&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Design and develop &lt;/strong&gt;software products and workflow tooling supporting global supply chain operations, from ingredient planning to logistics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Contribute&lt;/strong&gt; to the evolution of existing tooling and data processes into modular, scalable backend solutions aligned with HelloFresh’s growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work&lt;/strong&gt; closely with stakeholders across Procurement, Production, and Data Engineering to help translate operational requirements into technical solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Contribute&lt;/strong&gt; to engineering best practices around code quality, reliability, maintainability, and system design within the broader engineering setup.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Improve and optimize&lt;/strong&gt; complex data workflows and production logic to support evolving operational needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Support&lt;/strong&gt; knowledge sharing and collaboration across engineers through activities such as code reviews, technical discussions, and documentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring: The Ingredients&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive backend engineering experience, ideally within JVM-based ecosystems such as Kotlin or Java. Experience with Python is a plus, especially in operational or workflow-heavy environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience building scalable backend systems and services, including familiarity with event-driven architectures and messaging technologies such as Kafka, RabbitMQ, or SQS.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Basic SQL and data modeling skills, with the ability to work confidently in data-heavy domains. Exposure to tools like Airflow, Databricks, or Pandas is beneficial but not required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing modular, maintainable systems and translating complex business processes into reliable technical solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with modern cloud and infrastructure tooling such as AWS, Kubernetes, CI/CD pipelines, and observability practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An agile and product-minded approach to problem solving, with the ability to navigate ambiguity, collaborate closely with stakeholders, and proactively shape solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
